[00:26.28]1. Kind and patient, perfect in love,
[00:33.86]Was Christ, who came down from above.
[00:40.72]He took care of our needs
[00:44.96]With words and by deeds;
[00:48.02]He gave of his time and his love.
[00:56.08]He would keep the lowly in mind
[01:02.62]By healing the sick, deaf, and blind.
[01:10.22]To his royal commission he proved true
[01:17.04]And willingly said: “I want to.”
[01:28.64]2. We now try to follow his way
[01:51.96]In all of our dealings each day.
[01:58.40]We are loving and kind
[02:01.94]To all whom we find;
[02:05.50]We help them to learn and obey.
[02:13.72]We respond to friends when in need;
[02:21.06]We love them in word and in deed.
[02:27.18]So if widows and orphans should ask you,
[02:35.60]Then readily say: “I want to.”
